<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:04:17 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>衰老过程中伴侣介导的自噬下降会损害衰老细胞的巨噬细胞清除率</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/decline-of-chaperone-mediated-autophagy-in-aging-impairs-macrophage-clearance-of-senescent-cells</link><description>这项研究着眼于衰老过程中伴侣介导的自噬的下降如何改变衰老细胞的特性，从而导致其免疫清除受损。作者利用蛋白质组学和代谢组学分析表明，恢复自噬可以增强巨噬细胞功能并减少衰老细胞的积累。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/decline-of-chaperone-mediated-autophagy-in-aging-impairs-macrophage-clearance-of-senescent-cells.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 18:04:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/decline-of-chaperone-mediated-autophagy-in-aging-impairs-macrophage-clearance-of-senescent-cells</guid></item><item><title>人工智能的行为更像是大脑而不是数据库——认知科学在其起源故事中的作用有助于解释原因</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ai-behaves-more-like-a-brain-than-a-database-cognitive-sciences-role-in-its-origin-story-helps-explain-why</link><description>现代人工智能的存在归功于认知科学和计算机科学。您对其起源故事的设想可能会影响您如何理解大型语言模型的功能。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ai-behaves-more-like-a-brain-than-a-database-cognitive-sciences-role-in-its-origin-story-helps-explain-why.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:49:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ai-behaves-more-like-a-brain-than-a-database-cognitive-sciences-role-in-its-origin-story-helps-explain-why</guid></item><item><title>NASA 将报道诺斯罗普·格鲁曼公司 CRS-24 航天器的起飞</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasa-to-cover-northrop-grumman-crs-24-spacecraft-departure</link><description>在为 NASA 向国际空间站运送了超过 11,000 磅的物资、科学实验和其他货物后，诺斯罗普·格鲁曼公司的天鹅座 XL 航天器计划于 10 月 9 日星期五出发，作为该公司商业补给服务 24 任务（或诺斯罗普·格鲁曼 CRS-24）的一部分。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-to-cover-northrop-grumman-crs-24-spacecraft-departure.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:34:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasa-to-cover-northrop-grumman-crs-24-spacecraft-departure</guid></item><item><title>摘要：通讯地址：Leif W</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/abstract-address-correspondence-to-leif-w</link><description>埃里森，CPZN 4,204,185 Cambridge Street, Boston, Massachusetts, 2,114, USA。电子邮件：&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/abstract187.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:19:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/abstract-address-correspondence-to-leif-w</guid></item><item><title>雷·库兹韦尔在新书中提出了更多史诗般的主张</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ray-kurzweil-makes-more-epic-claims-in-new-book</link><description>这位未来学家在他的最新著作中加倍强调了奇点。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ray-kurzweil-makes-more-epic-claims-in-new-book.jpg" /&gt; 由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 17:04:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ray-kurzweil-makes-more-epic-claims-in-new-book</guid></item><item><title>超级智能时代将由信任定义</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-super-intelligence-era-will-be-defined-by-trust</link><description>大多数关于人工智能的争论仍然从自主性开始：这些系统应该被允许独立做多少事情？这是一个公平的问题，但它并不是决定一个机构是否可以使用它们的问题。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-super-intelligence-era-will-be-defined-by-trust2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:49:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/the-super-intelligence-era-will-be-defined-by-trust</guid></item><item><title>Hopfield 网络中分层原型的出现</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/hierarchical-prototyoe-emergence-in-hopfield-networks</link><description>一项新研究《现代霍普菲尔德模型中的分层原型出现》探讨了联想记忆模型如何不仅可以学习单个示例，还可以学习连接它们的更深层次结构，并有可能使用该结构来创建新的、合理的示例。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:34:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/hierarchical-prototyoe-emergence-in-hopfield-networks</guid></item><item><title>工业机器人培训模拟刚刚达到无人预算的上限</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/industrial-robotics-training-sims-just-hit-a-ceiling-nobody-budgeted-for</link><description>大连理工大学 (VA-Bench) 的新基准测试了 12 个多模态 AI 模型在机器人手臂操作任务上的表现。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/industrial-robotics-training-sims-just-hit-a-ceiling-nobody-budgeted-for.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:19:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/industrial-robotics-training-sims-just-hit-a-ceiling-nobody-budgeted-for</guid></item><item><title>詹姆斯·韦伯揭示了为什么行星的形成是一场与时间的赛跑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/james-webb-reveals-why-planet-formation-is-a-race-against-time</link><description>詹姆斯韦伯太空望远镜揭示了新生行星在其形成行星的气体供应消失之前正在与强大的风和辐射竞争。詹姆斯韦伯太空望远镜揭示了年轻的行星系统通过强大的喷流、分子风和辐射驱动的外流的不断变化的组合而失去其行星形成气体。随着圆盘的老化和气体的消失，巨行星形成巨大大气层的窗口期正在缩小。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/james-webb-reveals-why-planet-formation-is-a-race-against-time.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 16:04:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/james-webb-reveals-why-planet-formation-is-a-race-against-time</guid></item><item><title>Agentic AI 将简单的语言转化为微电子的自引导 X 射线扫描</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/agentic-ai-turns-simple-language-into-self-guided-x-ray-scans-of-microelectronics</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 15:49:14 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/agentic-ai-turns-simple-language-into-self-guided-x-ray-scans-of-microelectronics</guid></item></channel></rss>